WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.498
Forms let visitors send you information. Let's make them work for everyone.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:08.662
Give every input a label, linked with for and id.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:13.660
Use the right type, like tel or email, so phones show the right keyboard.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:18.393
Make buttons big enough to tap, and keep strong colour contrast.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.846
And make sure the form works with a keyboard alone.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:31.142
Before you move on, check: Build a form with labelled inputs. Use tel or email input types. Check you can use it with the keyboard only.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:35.435
In the next lesson: A little JavaScript.
